WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.772
What if the Moon disappeared tonight?

2
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.548
Nothing would explode. But the ocean would notice first.

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.840
The Moon drives most of our tides. Without it, they would shrink to less than half.

4
00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:19.142
And every night would be as dark as a new moon.

5
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.667
Over millions of years, Earth’s tilt could wobble much more, and the seasons could swing to extremes.

6
00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:31.250
So tonight, look up.

7
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:35.666
That pale rock keeps our oceans moving, and our seasons steady.
